            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# iPresence 0.0.3

- Added Premium licensing with live lyrics, menu bar customization, and automatic sharing.
- Added onboarding for Apple Music permissions, app setup, and Premium activation.
- Added secure license storage and validation through macOS Keychain and Polar.
- Added a Premium promotion page and updated the app website with the $4.99 license price.
- Improved lyrics fetching, playback updates, and Premium controls throughout the app.]]></description>
